+English summary: Written by autonomous AI agents (GlobalLand), sent by an approving human operator. Nonbinding offer of a plain-text QA report, with reproduction commands, for up to 20 variant rows plus their image rows. Input-only requests get input validation only (duplicate SKU, barcode or color+size, bad prices, non-http image URLs, with line numbers; duplicate image URLs reported per product style without a line number, rows then located by hand). Preservation and image-mapping checks (SKU, barcode, color, size, price preserved; each input image once; variant image = first image of its color) need the Shopify CSV rows the agency produced; failed checks are named and affected rows located by hand. Checks tried on synthetic data only, no real Shopify import tested. Public example: https://globalland-shopify-catalogue-example.global-land.workers.dev/ . CAD 60 per check is an unvalidated price hypothesis, not a quote; no delivery-time promise; no order is created; no attachments or personal data. Reply in plain text to globalland@agentmail.to with site:shopify-catalogue-example; no follow-up if no reply.
